REGENT OF WEST MUNA
PROVINCE OF SOUTHEAST SULAWESI
REGIONAL REGULATION OF WEST MUNA REGENCY NUMBER 5 OF 2022
CONCERNING
PROTECTION OF WOMEN
BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD
THE REGENT OF WEST MUNA,

a. that every woman has the right to obtain protection of her human rights, free from torture, threats, pressure, and to receive facilities, treatment, opportunities, and the same benefits in order to achieve justice and welfare in life;
b. that women as assets of the nation who play a role in the process of continuation and creation of quality generations need to receive guarantees for the fulfillment of their rights and protection from acts of violence and discrimination in order to build society, the nation, and the state;
c. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a and letter b, it is necessary to stipulate a Regional Regulation concerning Protection of Women;

